class=\"ct-text-editor-inner elementor-clearfix\">\n\t\t<p><strong>INTRODUCTION:<\/strong><\/p><p>The Pillars Dream Living Foundation initiated a project in 2024 to support and empower widows in Kano State through the distribution of grinding machines and start-up capital. This report outlines the project&#8217;s scope, implementation, and impact on the beneficiaries from Kaduna, Zaria, and Kano.<\/p><p><strong>PROJECT BACKGROUND:<\/strong><\/p><p>The initiative aimed to provide widows with the necessary resources and tools to start their businesses, promoting self-sufficiency and financial independence. By distributing grinding machines and start-up capital, the project sought to improve the livelihoods of widows and enhance their social and economic well-being.<\/p><p><strong>OBJECTIVES:<\/strong><\/p><p>a) To distribute grinding machines and start-up capital to widows in Kano State.<\/p><p>b) To empower widows to start their businesses and generate income.<\/p><p>c) To enhance the social and economic well-being of widows in the targeted communities.<\/p><p><strong>IMPLEMENTATION:<\/strong><\/p><p>a) Beneficiary Identification: Widows from Kaduna, Zaria, and Kano were identified as beneficiaries of the project. Eligible participants were selected based on their socio-economic status and need for financial support.<\/p><p>b) Distribution of Grinding Machines: Each beneficiary received a grinding machine to enable them to start a small-scale business. The machines were distributed during a designated event, where beneficiaries were also provided with demonstrations and training on proper usage and maintenance.<\/p><p>c) Start-Up Capital: In addition to the grinding machines, each beneficiary received 30,000 Naira in start-up capital to cover initial operational expenses and help establish their businesses.<\/p>\t\t\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3505dae5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_text_editor\" data-id=\"3505dae5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"ct_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"ct_text_editor-3505dae5\" class=\"ct-text-editor \" data-wow-delay=\"ms\">\n\t<div class=\"ct-inline-css\"  data-css=\"\n        \t\t\">\n\n    <\/div>\n\t<div class=\"ct-text-editor-inner elementor-clearfix\">\n\t\t<p><strong>IMPACT:<\/strong><\/p><p>a) Enhanced Livelihoods: The project enabled beneficiaries to start their businesses, providing a source of income and improving their financial independence.<\/p><p>b) Empowerment: By equipping widows with the tools and resources to become entrepreneurs, the initiative empowered them to take control of their economic well-being and gain confidence in their abilities.<\/p><p>c) Social and Economic Well-being: The project contributed to enhancing the social and economic well-being of widows in the targeted communities, fostering a sense of community and resilience among beneficiaries.<\/p>\t\t\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t        <section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-1903b3f6 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-column-none ct-row-scroll-none ct-row-gradient--none ct-row-container--default\" data-id=\"1903b3f6\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n            \n                        <div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended \">\n                    <div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6884d36a ct-column-none col-offset-none\" data-id=\"6884d36a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n        <div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n                    \n        \t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-